// pkg/redis/timeseries.bit — `r.timeseries(key)`: the RedisTimeSeries handle. Epic
// #6013, #6028: SCAFFOLD ONLY, no commands wired yet (`TS.ADD, TS.RANGE, TS.CREATE`, a
// follow-up ticket) — this file exists so later family tickets touch only
// their own file, never `client.bit`. `cmd.bit`'s header is the template:
